stalt ist, sondern ein Mensch, der in Herzensg\u00fcte, Unschuld und Reinheit der Vollkommenheit so nahe wie m\u00f6glich kommt. Dies ist der erste von drei B\u00e4nden.", "industryIdentifiers": [{"type": "ISBN_13", "identifier": "9783988688453"}, {"type": "ISBN_10", "identifier": "3988688452"}], "readingModes": {"text": false, "image": true}, "pageCount": 392, "printType": "BOOK", "categories": ["Travel"], "maturityRating": "NOT_MATURE", "allowAnonLogging": false, "contentVersion": "preview-1.0.0", "panelizationSummary": {"containsEpubBubbles": false, "containsImageBubbles": false}, "imageLinks": {"smallThumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=zm1EEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=5&edge=curl&source=gbs_api", "thumbnail": "http://books.google.com/books/content?id=zm1EEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&edge=curl&source=gbs_api"}, "language": "de", "previewLink": "http://books.google.co.in/books?id=zm1EEQAAQBAJ&printsec=frontcover&dq=intitle:transhimalaja+inauthor:hedin&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&cd=6&source=gbs_api", "infoLink": "http://books.google.co.in/books?id=zm1EEQAAQBAJ&dq=intitle:transhimalaja+inauthor:hedin&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api", "canonicalVolumeLink": "https://books.google.com/books/about/Transhimalaja_Band_1.html?hl=&id=zm1EEQAAQBAJ"}, "saleInfo": {"country": "IN", "saleability": "NOT_FOR_SALE", "isEbook": false}, "accessInfo": {"country": "IN", "viewability": "PARTIAL", "embeddable": true, "publicDomain": false, "textToSpeechPermission": "ALLOWED", "epub": {"isAvailable": false}, "pdf": {"isAvailable": true, "acsTokenLink": "http://books.google.co.in/books/download/Transhimalaja_Band_1-sample-pdf.acsm?id=zm1EEQAAQBAJ&format=pdf&output=acs4_fulfillment_token&dl_type=sample&source=gbs_api"}, "webReaderLink": "http://play.google.com/books/reader?id=zm1EEQAAQBAJ&hl=&as_pt=BOOKS&source=gbs_api", "accessViewStatus": "SAMPLE", "quoteSharingAllowed": false}, "searchInfo": {"textSnippet": "Eines der bedeutendsten je geschriebenen Reiseb\u